        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "t2j4qzikr8of",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Gastronomic Delights at "
            },
            {
              "_key": "q3vyv1t3a7rj",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "a2mq8zg0tthk"
              ],
              "text": "Saint Catherine"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "a2mq8zg0tthk",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58925",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Gastronomic Delights at Saint Catherine: Bedouin Camp Restaurant"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Amid the tranquil desert landscapes and towering peaks of Saint Catherine, visitors can indulge in an authentic culinary experience that captures the essence of Egypt and Bedouin culture. The Bedouin Camp Restaurant offers not just a meal, but a journey into the heart of Sinai’s traditional gastronomy and warm hospitality."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Bedouin Camp Restaurant"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Fusion of Egyptian and Bedouin Flavors"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Specializing in a delightful combination of traditional Egyptian and Bedouin dishes, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Bedouin Camp Restaurant"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " offers an extensive menu infused with regional spices and time-honored recipes. Each dish reflects the deep cultural heritage of the Sinai Peninsula, with flavors that are as bold as the surrounding desert landscapes."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Refreshing Beverages and Decadent Desserts"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Complementing the savory meals is a selection of desserts and an impressive variety of hot and cold beverages. Whether you’re seeking a cooling drink after a day of exploring, or a soothing cup of tea under the star-lit Sinai sky, the restaurant caters to every taste."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "All-Day Dining Experience"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000017",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Bedouin Camp Restaurant welcomes guests from early morning to late evening. Visitors can enjoy a hearty breakfast before embarking on their adventures, a satisfying midday meal, or a peaceful dinner surrounded by the serene mountain backdrop."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000019",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Prime Location in El Milga, Saint Catherine"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nestled in the scenic village of El Milga in South Sinai, Egypt, the restaurant provides a convenient stop for travelers exploring the historic and natural wonders of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001b"
              ],
              "text": "Saint Catherine"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Its cozy, rustic setting offers a perfect retreat after a day of trekking or sightseeing."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/saint-catherine-travel-guide/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/saint-catherine",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Nearby attractions:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Saint Catherine’s Monastery, Mount Sinai, Wadi El Arbain, and Gebel Abbas Basha."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/St-Catherines-Monastery-with-Jebel-Musa-tb062205290.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "St. Catherine's Monastery at the base of a rugged mountain under a clear blue sky"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "St. Catherine's Monastery - A historical bastion of spirituality nestled in the embrace of Mount Sinai's granite arms"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/75d88307aa4173602e9007dfe13a9da5.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Snow-covered stone cabins on a mountain slope with misty peaks in the background"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Retreat into the serene embrace of the mountains, where snow whispers secrets of the highlands"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000025",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Culinary Journey Through Egypt: A Taste of Tradition and Innovation"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000027",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Savor the flavors of Egypt on a culinary adventure that spans traditional dishes to contemporary cuisine. From aromatic street food in bustling markets to gourmet dining along the Nile, our guide invites you to feast on the rich tastes of Egypt. Click here to embark on your delicious journey!"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000029",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Learn more"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "kpg8bo17mwcl",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Delicias Gastronómicas en "
            },
            {
              "_key": "xzg3tr4so7vf",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "26pii47c3iqc"
              ],
              "text": "Santa Catalina"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "26pii47c3iqc",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58925",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Delicias Gastronómicas en Santa Catalina: Restaurante Bedouin Camp"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Entre los tranquilos paisajes desérticos y los imponentes picos de Santa Catalina, los visitantes pueden disfrutar de una experiencia culinaria auténtica que encierra la esencia de Egipto y la cultura beduina. El restaurante "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Bedouin Camp"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " ofrece mucho más que una comida: es un viaje al corazón de la gastronomía tradicional del Sinaí y de su hospitalidad cálida y generosa."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Restaurante Bedouin Camp"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Una fusión de sabores egipcios y beduinos"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Especializado en una deliciosa combinación de platos tradicionales egipcios y beduinos, el "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Restaurante Bedouin Camp"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " presenta un extenso menú impregnado de especias locales y recetas ancestrales. Cada platillo refleja la rica herencia cultural de la península del Sinaí, con sabores tan intensos y auténticos como los paisajes desérticos que lo rodean."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Bebidas refrescantes y postres irresistibles"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Para acompañar los sabores salados, el restaurante ofrece una selección de postres y una variada carta de bebidas frías y calientes. Ya sea que busques algo refrescante después "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000015"
              ],
              "text": "de un"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " día de exploración, o una taza de té reconfortante bajo el cielo estrellado del Sinaí, aquí encontrarás la opción ideal."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/excursion-de-un-dia-para-visitar-el-cairo-desde-alejandria/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/alexandria-to-cairo-private-day-tour-of-giza-pyramids-sphinx-egyptian-museum-khan-el-khalili",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Una experiencia gastronómica todo el día"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El restaurante Bedouin Camp recibe a sus comensales desde la mañana temprano hasta bien entrada la noche. Puedes comenzar el día con un desayuno nutritivo antes de tus "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001c"
              ],
              "text": "aventuras"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", disfrutar de un almuerzo revitalizante o terminar la jornada con una cena tranquila frente al majestuoso telón de fondo montañoso."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/cultura-y-aventura-en-el-oasis-de-siwa/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/cultura-y-aventura-en-el-oasis-de-siwa",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Ubicación privilegiada en El Milga, Santa Catalina"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Ubicado en la pintoresca aldea de El Milga, en el sur del Sinaí, el restaurante es una parada ideal para quienes exploran los tesoros históricos y naturales de Santa Catalina. Su entorno acogedor y rústico lo convierte en el refugio perfecto después de una jornada de senderismo o visitas culturales."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000029",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Atracciones cercanas:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000026"
              ],
              "text": "Monasterio de Santa Catalina"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", Monte Sinaí, Wadi El Arbain y Gebel Abbas Basha."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/monasterio-de-santa-catalina/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/saint-catherine/monasterio-de-santa-catalina",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
